  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-27T23:08:14.980Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The three locomotion options are pretty good but none of them totally fit my needs. \nI like to play standing up and I like to turn in real life (avoiding the use of the right joystick when using controllers).\nThe 3rd option (1-axis movement), works quite well in this case but the ability to jump is disabled. I think you should still be able to use the jump hand gesture on the right hand in this mode. \nThe 2nd option (2-axis movement) is nice because jumping is enabled and fake turning is also available in case I sit down for a bit. However, when moving, I cannot change the direction I'm heading by turning my body in real life.\nFor the full explanation and demonstration, please see my video: \nhttps://youtu.be/T-MQrmWNKyQ",
